Package: spatialGPCA
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Genetic Principal Components from Location-Aggregated Genotypes
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Yihe", "Yang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "yxy1234@case.edu", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6563-3579"))
Description: Fits a weighted local Gaussian process conditional on location-level
    fixed effects, using a native C++ engine with prior whitening,
    full-variant shared smoothing-parameter selection and dynamic spatial PCA.
    Prepared PLINK BED inputs are decoded directly in C++ and accumulated
    by location without retaining a complete genotype matrix. An individual
    table supplies identifiers, geographic coordinates and all fixed effects.
    Independent geographic clustering and editable spatial-scale plots precede
    genotype-based REML or GCV smoothing selection.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: Rcpp, ggplot2, maps, grid
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown
SystemRequirements: C++17, BLAS, LAPACK
NeedsCompilation: yes
URL: https://github.com/harryyiheyang/spatialGPCA
